# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# DO NOT ignore the experience ledger. Per the Meta-Harness methodology and
# DESIGN.md, git is an APPEND-ONLY experience store: every evaluated candidate
# (kept, dominated, infeasible, or crashed) and all of its diagnostic traces are
# tracked on purpose. These are NOT generated artifacts to be discarded.
#
# The experience bundles, the Pareto frontier, and the flat ledger are tracked:
#   !experience/
#   !results.tsv
#   !frontier.json
# The heatmaps and raw fields inside them are the diagnostics the agent reads
# back to close the loop -- they must stay in version control.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
!experience/
!experience/**
!results.tsv
!frontier.json
